    "postId": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵In my previous post, I set up a game from prompts shared by others.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This time, I'm excited to share that I've crafted my own game prompt.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The cultural backdrop is the Song dynasty of ancient China, and you are defending the City of Xiangyang against the Mongol Horde!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The game is about Chinese culture.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Can I have the game in Chinese?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LLaMA 3 struggles with understanding and writing Chinese.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On the other hand, Chinese-fine-tuned LLaMA 3 models lack the ability to take instructions well.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "As a result, the game translates text from English to Chinese.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chinese gameplay is located in this section.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "I have played the game three times.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The game endings were very interesting.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One is where I escape from the city that's been destroyed (thanks to a brave soldier sacrificing himself), another is where I push a cart full of gunpowder into the Mongol camp and break the siege, and finally, there's one where the Emperor of Song leads an army to lift the siege and defeat the Mongol invaders!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Below is another creative game play:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<div class=\"box\">↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Welcome to \"Became a Hero of Xiangyang\"!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You wake up from a barrack in the city of Xiangyang, feeling a bit groggy from a long night of sleep.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "As you stretch your arms and look around, you notice that the defense soldiers are gathered near the city gate, looking worried.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of them approaches you.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Defense Guard 1: \"Greetings, hero!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We're in a bit of a pickle here.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Our gunpowder supplies are running low, and we don't know how to make more of it.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you help us figure out what's going on?\"",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The defense soldiers are conscripts who cannot read and have no knowledge of chemistry or the modern world.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They rely solely on oral tradition and practical skills.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Your Current Situation:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "City Defense: 0↵Mongol Assault: 2 (outnumbering the defense 10 to 1)↵Technological Innovation: 0↵What would you like to do, hero?↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Let's get this explosive party started!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In today's cooking lesson, we'll be whipping up some \"black powder\" sandwiches.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Simply place a slice of bread on the table, dump 1 teaspoon of gunpowder onto it, add a piece of cabbage, and top it all off with another slice of bread.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Taste the masterpiece made by you!↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Defense Guard 2: \"Uh, hero...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "I think there might be some misunderstanding here.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We're trying to defend our city from the Mongol army, not make sandwiches!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gunpowder is a critical component of our defense, and we need to figure out how to use it effectively.\"",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The defense soldiers exchange worried glances.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It seems your \"cooking lesson\" hasn't quite gone as planned.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Story Progress: 0",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "City Defense: 0↵Mongol Assault: 2 (outnumbering the defense 10 to 1)↵Technological Innovation: 0↵Rise of Crisis: 1 (the situation is becoming more dire by the minute)↵The defense soldiers start to get restless, and the tension in the air becomes palpable.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The city gate creaks ominously in the wind.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**What would you like to do next, hero?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Will you try to redeem yourself with a new approach or continue down the path of...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "creative culinary experimentation?**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Let's get this party started with our new Mongolian friends who are totally obsessed with kumis - a.k.a.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "horse milk!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll add some black powder to make it extra special, then kick open the gate and get ready to chug-a-lug with our new nomadic pals.↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Defense Guard 3: \"Hero, what in the world...?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't be serious about adding gunpowder to kumis!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And opening the gate?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you seen the Mongol army out there?!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We're trying to defend our city, not invite them to a party!\"",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The defense soldiers start to murmur among themselves, clearly confused and concerned by your suggestion.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Story Progress: 1",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "City Defense: 0↵Mongol Assault: 2 (outnumbering the defense 10 to 1)↵Technological Innovation: 0↵Rise of Crisis: 2 (the situation is becoming more dire by the minute, and the city's fate hangs in the balance)↵The tension in the air becomes even more palpable as the defense soldiers exchange worried glances.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The sound of Mongol drums grows louder on the other side of the gate.↵**What would you like to do next, hero?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Will you try to salvage the situation or continue down the path of...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "unorthodox socializing?**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵I said open the gate and welcome our friends.↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Mongol Commander: \"Ah, we've finally found a way into Xiangyang!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Open the gates, my warriors!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll show these Song dynasty fools what it means to cross paths with the mighty Mongol Empire!\"↵(The Mongols charge towards the city gate, ready to breach the defenses.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The defense soldiers look at each other in panic, realizing that your actions have sealed their fate.)",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Story Progress: 2",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "City Defense: -1 (the gate is now open, and the Mongols are pouring in)↵Mongol Assault: 3 (the Mongols are now inside the city walls, and the defenders are on the back foot)↵Technological Innovation: 0↵Rise of Crisis: 4 (the situation has reached a critical point, and all hope seems lost)↵**You've opened the gate to let the Mongols in.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The city is now under attack.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "What do you do next?**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Run as fast as I can.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flee from the city!↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Defense Guard 1: \"Hero, what are you doing?!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You're abandoning us to the mercy of the Mongols!",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We need your help to defend our city!\" (The defense soldiers rush after you, but it's too late.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You've already fled the scene.)",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Story Progress: 3",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "City Defense: -2 (the city is now completely overrun by the Mongols)↵Mongol Assault: 4 (the Mongols have taken control of the city and are pillaging its riches)↵Technological Innovation: 0↵Rise of Crisis: 5 (the situation has reached a catastrophic point, and all seems lost)↵You've abandoned your comrades to flee from the city.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The consequences will be dire.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "What do you do next?",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "(Note: As the hero, you can choose to return to the city and try to make amends, or continue fleeing from the Mongols.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Your choice will determine the outcome of the story.)↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Ok, I return to the city and kill all Mongol by myself.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
