    },
    {
      "text": "I am a super kung fu hero!↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Mongol Commander: \"Hah?!",
