        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "City Defense: -2 (the city is still occupied, but there's a glimmer of hope)↵Mongol Assault: -3 (the Mongols are being pushed back, but they're not yet defeated)↵Technological Innovation: 0↵Rise of Crisis: 5 (the situation is still critical, but you've given the city a chance to fight back)↵The battle rages on.",
