      "text": "(Note: You can choose to continue fighting the Mongols, try to rescue any prisoners, or help the city's defenders regroup and plan their counterattack.)↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Blow up gun powder you hide and kill all the Mongol.↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵Mongol Commander: \"NOOO!",
