        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "(Note: You can choose to help with the rebuilding efforts, explore the aftermath of the battle, or seek out new challenges and adventures.)↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Rebuild?",
