        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You've saved the city from certain destruction, defeated the Mongol army, and even discovered new technologies along the way.",
