        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI Game - Hero of Xiangyang",
        "url": "/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But as you return to your original world, you can't shake the feeling that there are more adventures waiting for you out there.",
